### Inscription
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Papa",
  "email": "papa@test.com",
  "password": "MotDePasse1!"
}

### Connexion (copier le token reçu dans la variable ci-dessous)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "papa@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJwYXBhQHRlc3QuY29tIiwiaWF0IjoxNzkzNTcxMDM4LCJleHAiOjE3OTM2NTc0Mzh9.SFebWQAO3v8E_vEnQr7aoUZzOj5B-iTgv_IuRGQpsSMpzBCzIYzrNEyNrd63qJOf

### Ajouter une candidature
POST http://localhost:8081/api/candidatures
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entreprise": "Capgemini",
  "poste": "Stage développeur Java",
  "lieu": "Strasbourg",
  "dateCandidature": "2026-10-01",
  "statut": "ENVOYEE",
  "lienOffre": "https://exemple.com/offre",
  "notes": "Relancer dans 10 jours"
}

### Lister mes candidatures
GET http://localhost:8081/api/candidatures
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtrer par statut
GET http://localhost:8081/api/candidatures?statut=ENVOYEE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Candidatures à relancer
GET http://localhost:8081/api/candidatures/relances
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Marquer une candidature comme relancée (relance suivante dans 7 jours)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/candidatures/1/relancer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Statistiques
GET http://localhost:8081/api/candidatures/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Modifier une candidature
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/candidatures/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entreprise": "Capgemini",
  "poste": "Stage développeur Java",
  "lieu": "Strasbourg",
  "dateCandidature": "2026-10-01",
  "statut": "ENTRETIEN",
  "lienOffre": "https://exemple.com/offre",
  "notes": "Entretien prévu le 15/10"
}

### Supprimer une candidature
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/candidatures/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
